  "description": "Put yourself and other drivers at ease, upgrade with a new high-performance set of YITAMOTOR headlights, and feel more confident when driving at night.\nFitment\n1997-2005 Chevy Venture\n1997-2004 Oldsmobile Silhouette\n1997-1998 Pontiac Trans Sport models only\n1999-2005 Pontiac Montana\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nVehicle Compatibility - Headlight assembly compatible with 1997-2005 Chevy Venture / 1997-2004 Oldsmobile Silhouette / 1997-1998 Pontiac Trans Sport / 1999-2005 Pontiac Montana; high/low beam mode 9004. Note: Bulbs and wiring harness are NOT included. Please verify your vehicle's model and year before purchase\nWaterproof– Fully sealed with solid silicone and equipped with one-way pressure-equalizing vents, the housing prevents moisture buildup and condensation\nEnhanced Brightness – The metallic parabolic reflectors optimize light output, delivering a broader, smoother, and more focused beam. Experience enhanced nighttime visibility and reduced eye strain for safer driving\nSide Safety Reflector – Built-in micro-prism reflectors on the sides make your vehicle highly visible to oncoming traffic and pedestrians at night. This passive safety feature ensures you are seen from all angles, reducing collision risks\nPlug-and-Play & All-Weather Versatility – Designed for direct OEM replacement with factory connectors, no cutting or special tools required. Ideal for daily commutes, off-road adventures, or extreme weather conditions",
